Usage: grid brain keep [--task <task>] [flags]
<task> is an id, exact folder name, or folder path inside a project tasks directory.
  -body string
    	Markdown body (otherwise stdin)
  -description string
    	when to read the note
  -external
    	quarantine externally sourced text
  -file string
    	Markdown with front matter, or - for stdin
  -json
    	print JSON
  -level string
    	home or project
  -link value
    	link object with to, rel, summary and why
  -name string
    	note name
  -project string
    	project name or id
  -source string
    	source task, Job or person
  -summary string
    	what the note contains
  -task string
    	include proposals from this task
  -topic string
    	topic
